	quest.73DFB51FF0D9411C.title: "DEV Changelog"
	quest.74FC0DDDB91DB172.quest_desc: [
		"To make life that much easier, AE2 provides a whole suite of devices for the manipulation of ME data, i.e. moving stored items around the world."
		""
		"The &bME Interface&f is one of these devices. As an input device, the Interface allows any item/fluid/etc to be piped externally through it, which is then automatically stored in the ME Network that the interface is connected to."
		""
		"As an output device, the Interface can be configured to keep a certain available amount of a stored item in stock, from the ME network to its own internal inventory. This allows items to then be received by some external source like another player or some pipe."
	]
	quest.74FC0DDDB91DB172.title: "The IO"
	quest.751918B18C6F4ECC.quest_subtitle: "turns osmium into different ingots"
	quest.754497AD42B7D3D4.quest_subtitle: "electricity and fuel for create!"
	quest.75486180B2031285.quest_subtitle: "allows the digital miner able to replace mined ores with stone"
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_desc: ["The &6deployer&r is the start of automation as it is used in many different multi step crafts like &6precision mechanisms&r and many others"]
	quest.75619B23BB13A8D7.quest_subtitle: "Start of automation"
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_desc: [
		"Connecting &bsails&r to a plank or any block ontop of the &9windmill bearing&r will generate more stress"
		""
		"You can place them in any shape you like"
	]
	quest.7569BB5427BCA43F.quest_subtitle: "More sails = quicker windmill = more stress created"
	quest.7588C9554B59EA62.quest_desc: ["You have successfully synthesized &5Antimatter&r."]
	quest.7588C9554B59EA62.quest_subtitle: "The Impossible Achieved"
	quest.7588C9554B59EA62.title: "Antimatter"
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_desc: ["The &6Goggles&r are really helpful to be able to see how much stress units (SU) machines are using or producing, it's really nice to be able to see why you machines have stopped"]
	quest.76B45C5766C61369.quest_subtitle: "See extra information"
	quest.76D185BEC0C37EC0.quest_subtitle: "64x base storage capacity"
	quest.7713894F96979D3A.quest_subtitle: "A faster pickaxe that uses energy to work"
	quest.77C9EE701F72586D.quest_desc: [
		"&bPortable Cells&f function identically to regular cells in that they can they be inserted into a chest or drive and filled accordingly."
		""
		"However, unlike regular cells, their contents can also be accessed standalone via the cell item itself, a bit like a digital ME-flavoured backpack."
	]
	quest.780712A5A04E3E13.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.780712A5A04E3E13.quest_subtitle: "This path of machines will help you produce some Fissile Fuel, that is needed for the \"Fission Reactor\" to work!"
	quest.78311531069807DE.quest_desc: [
		"In Applied Energistics 2, every ME network has a certain number of &echannels&f available, which simply means how many networked devices can fit on the whole network."
		""
		"As a rule of thumb, any device that more or less handles ME data directly (items stored within the network) and carries out some form of I/O will take up a channel. Usually components that are only concerned with the internal power storage of the network, like &eEnergy Cells&f and &eInscribers&f, do &onot&r take up channels."
		""
		"Networks without an &bME Controller&f are known as \"ad-hoc\" networks and only support a maximum of 8 channels."
	]
	quest.78311531069807DE.title: "Foreword on Channels"
	quest.79769004F4EB9285.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.79769004F4EB9285.quest_subtitle: "You have successfully synthesized Plutonium"
	quest.79769004F4EB9285.title: "Plutonium"
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_desc: ["The &6mechinal drill&r is a item that will mine any block infront of it which is really nice for setting up farms that require blocks to be broken, like a cobblestone farm"]
	quest.79FCBEBFE6E29E44.quest_subtitle: "Mines for you"
	quest.7A6A5261F2755BF1.quest_subtitle: "electrical smelting"
	quest.7A912B457632672E.quest_subtitle: "this wire spool can connect to low current connectors"
	quest.7B7D1F0CB326B28F.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME IO Port&f allows for the contents of an ME network's storage to be quickly rearranged between different storage media such as ME cells and external containers connected to storage buses."
		""
		"When a cell is inserted in an input slot on the left, the IO Port can be toggled to either empty the cell out into other ME storages or fill the (ideally, partitioned) cell with certain items spread out across other storages."
	]
	quest.7B8E4F1DEC8AD248.quest_subtitle: "portable inferno"
	quest.7C3614F9D06BAA49.quest_subtitle: "reinforced flight"
	quest.7CB9A9819217D505.quest_subtitle: "safety apparel"
	quest.7CF5BD4235FE4539.quest_desc: [
		"The Supercritical Phase Shifter is the single most expensive and energy-intensive device."
		""
		""
		"Its primary function is to generate &5Antimatter&r, the final and most powerful material in Mekanism."
	]
	quest.7CF5BD4235FE4539.quest_subtitle: "Antimatter Synthesis"
	quest.7CF5BD4235FE4539.title: "Build your first supercritical phase shifter!"
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_desc: ["The &6brass funnel&r is an upgraded andesite funnel, lets you add item filters and moves upto a stack at a time"]
	quest.7DC9A48B25E63807.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded funnel"
	quest.7DFFD1F66AB6296F.title: "Visit crimson forest"
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6cart assembler&r has the ability to attach any machine you want to build to a minecart, it can also move blocks that aren't able to be moved in regular vanilla like budding ameythyst and spawners"
		""
		"&l&cIf you want to move spawners you need to enable it in the create configs&r&r"
	]
	quest.7EF1D870E752E4DA.quest_subtitle: "Maybe one of the most OP items"
	quest.7EFBAF3E281D2EBE.quest_desc: [
		"The &bME Storage Bus&f, when facing some external storage container, will allow the container to be used as though it were part of the ME network, allowing items to be taken out from the container or inserted into it purely via ME."
		""
		"Storage buses can be filtered and given specific priorities such that specific items will try to go to the attached storage first, however it will not retroactively move any filtered items from anywhere else in the network to its attached storage."
	]
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6encased fan&r has many different uses, it can be used to blast, wash, haunt and smoke items. The rotation will mean it either pushes or pulls air"
		""
		"To &cblast&r items you need to put a lava source infront of the fan"
		"To &9wash&r items you need to put a water source infront of the fan"
		"To &bhaunt&r items you need to put a soul campfire infront of the fan"
		"To &esmoke&r items you need to put a campire infront of the fan"
	]
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.quest_subtitle: "Has multiple uses"
	quest.7F5228C9A9FC87D5.title: "Encased fan"
	quest.7FAD53445B3A0946.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical companion"
